WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.145
The Sponsored Brands product collection ad format allows you to link to your store from your ad

00:00:06.145 --> 00:00:09.398
to help shoppers explore your full selection and brand.

00:00:09.398 --> 00:00:11.566
Here's how to set it up.

00:00:11.566 --> 00:00:14.096
First, choose the product collection ad format.

00:00:14.096 --> 00:00:19.518
You'll see options for your landing page, which is where your ad will link to.

00:00:19.518 --> 00:00:22.410
Here, choose your store as the landing page.

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:29.639
Use the drop-down option to choose your store and which page in your store you'd like to send shoppers

00:00:29.639 --> 00:00:30.000
to.
